From 7ceb551e153e15748e49a689ed898db0715b2f23 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alexander Koskovich <akoskovich@pm.me>
Date: Thu, 16 Apr 2026 22:41:13 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 044/144] net: ipa: add Eliza configuration data

Add the configuration data required for Eliza, which uses IPA v5.5.
Eliza differs from the shared v5.5 tables in three ways: a larger Q6
FnR counter count (and the memory layout that follows), and private
QSB and GSI endpoint tables.

Signed-off-by: Alexander Koskovich <akoskovich@pm.me>
Link: https://lore.kernel.org/linux-arm-msm/20260416-eliza-ipa-v1-4-f4109a8e43c4@pm.me/
[mrlund: keep private QSB and endpoint tables here instead of rewriting
the shared v5.5 tables; set fnr_idx_cnt to 68 for Eliza]
Signed-off-by: Martin Lund <mrlund@hotmail.com>
Assisted-by: Grok Bot
(cherry picked from commit 84ad7cfb50d85919ea3eff9e8421b103977c959a)

Import-Patch: pkgs/linux-kernel/sm8750/dodge/patches/7.3/0062-net-ipa-add-Eliza-configuration-data.patch
